### ==============================================================================
### WEEK 6: TODO API TEST REQUESTS (REST Client / Thunder Client)
### ==============================================================================
### Agar aap VS Code me 'REST Client' ya 'Thunder Client' extension use karte hain,
### toh aap direct har request ke upar 'Send Request' click karke test kar sakte hain.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check (Server running status check karein)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. CREATE TODO - Naya Task 1 banayein
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn PostgreSQL with Neon",
  "description": "Understand connection strings, pools, and SQL queries in Node.js"
}

### 3. CREATE TODO - Naya Task 2 banayein
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Week-6 Internship Assignment",
  "description": "Build and test the Todo CRUD backend API"
}

### 4. GET ALL TODOS - Saare tasks dekhein
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos

### 5. GET COMPLETED TODOS - Sirf completed tasks filter karein
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos?completed=true

### 6. GET PENDING TODOS - Sirf pending tasks filter karein
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos?completed=false

### 7. GET SINGLE TODO BY ID (Yahan ID change kar sakte hain, e.g. 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1

### 8. UPDATE TODO BY ID - Task modify karein
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Master PostgreSQL & Neon DB (Updated)",
  "description": "Completed understanding of connection pooling and parameters",
  "is_completed": false
}

### 9. TOGGLE TODO STATUS - Task status complete/pending toggle karein
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1/toggle

### 10. DELETE TODO BY ID - Task delete karein
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1

